  "transcription": "Add Ms a 94 18(88) (88)\n\nIf $2u = 11 + \\frac{1}{x}\\cdot\\left\\{\\frac{(1-x)(1-x^2)(1-x^3)\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x^5)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{15})\\cdots\\cdots}\\right\\}^6$\n\nand $2v = 1 + \\frac{1}{x^{\\frac{1}{5}}}\\left\\{\\frac{(1-x^{\\frac{1}{5}})(1-x^{\\frac{2}{5}})(1-x^{\\frac{3}{5}})\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x^5)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{15})\\cdots\\cdots}\\right\\}.$\n\nthen $\\sqrt[5]{\\sqrt{u^2+1}-u} = \\sqrt{v^2+1}-v$\n\n$= x^{\\frac{1}{5}}\\cdot\\frac{(1-x)(1-x^6)(1-x^{11})\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x^2)(1-x^7)(1-x^{12})\\cdots\\cdots}\\cdot\\frac{(1-x^4)(1-x^9)(1-x^{14})\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x^3)(1-x^8)(1-x^{13})\\cdots\\cdots}$\n\n$1+\\frac{x}{1-x}+\\frac{x^4}{(1-x)(1-x^2)}+\\cdots\\cdots$\n\n$=\\frac{1}{(1-x)(1-x^6)(1-x^{11})\\cdots}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1-x^4)(1-x^9)(1-x^{14})\\cdots}$\n\n$1+\\frac{x^2}{1-x}+\\frac{x^6}{(1-x)(1-x^2)}+\\frac{x^{12}}{(1-x)(1-x^2)(1-x^3)}+\\cdots$\n\n$=\\frac{1}{(1-x^2)(1-x^7)\\cdots}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1-x^3)(1-x^8)\\cdots}$",
